10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n7zicFqrs1MQ7kNvwFt9yR3&_nc_oc=AdqzLktUxHxcvfIUiMc-DdR1qt6Csl5J8cjPs-xMJ-gYCx6Qd7icmsJrH1kaVet7JlQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0QRAoCE6F1pMHi-FpO8VE6itO-5GQArWVyB_fCi1MYUw&oe=69EB7D4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BULwt8gs6VwQ7kNvwHaCudx&_nc_oc=Ado4X9KE9fcW8c6YzkeqiQcFrJleRTbl7OW0Hcg8TVKEq48f6VkpWIdd6HpozUBUSoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3O8RBQTgnKBQuh3a1WcG55a1dl2WmnF1VHTHzFA5xTjQ&oe=69EB55FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nDoQjBSt_YUQ7kNvwFZMDsg&_nc_oc=AdpEOy-3ip5rdpfKSy9eYf_VT55evx4Sqe38Fx-7InAQ8Mmd8NTVwI_prqY9Pg2arf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2h8blBDcugHEKZUoGBqEmNdnHGalxub5LaxcSaVPGA8w&oe=69EB6D2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore